        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Army of mercenaries with advanced weaponry is marching across the globe! You must find the one responsible and stop them! You must dodge, and cut!, hazards as you advance through various terrain. Cross the platforms over pitfalls and collect coins as you move through the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Mystic Ninja techniques and advanced technology to bring out your true strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dragon Ninja is a simple but fun and challenging game. The objective is to dodge the hazards and move across the platforms to get to the end of the level. Lasers move quickly but so do you! Level timers keep track of your best times! You can spend your hard earned coins in the store for decorations! You can use them to decorate your home on the main menu but some hold secret abilities! Allowing you to replay levels for better times and coins, or aid in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through the fishing sign are minigames to play! With 24 kinds of fish to catch and collect. Display your favorites in your home! Other games track High scores and award coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dev Notes-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I am a Learning solo indie dev and this is my first game! It's a simple game but I wanted to publish it to learn and set everything up. I want to make it the best it can be. So I plan to support it and do lots of updates! I am confident in making 2D games and hope to make more soon! Feedback is appreciated! Your support means a lot, thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updates Coming Soon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Art/Music - I want to improve on the art and music but will keep the same big pixel resolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Army of mercenaries with advanced weaponry is marching across the globe! You must find the one responsible and stop them! You must dodge, and cut!, hazards as you advance through various terrain. Cross the platforms over pitfalls and collect coins as you move through the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Mystic Ninja techniques and advanced technology to bring out your true strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dragon Ninja is a simple but fun and challenging game. The objective is to dodge the hazards and move across the platforms to get to the end of the level. Lasers move quickly but so do you! Level timers keep track of your best times! You can spend your hard earned coins in the store for decorations! You can use them to decorate your home on the main menu but some hold secret abilities! Allowing you to replay levels for better times and coins, or aid in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through the fishing sign are minigames to play! With 24 kinds of fish to catch and collect. Display your favorites in your home! Other games track High scores and award coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dev Notes-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I am a Learning solo indie dev and this is my first game! It's a simple game but I wanted to publish it to learn and set everything up. I want to make it the best it can be. So I plan to support it and do lots of updates! I am confident in making 2D games and hope to make more soon! Feedback is appreciated! Your support means a lot, thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updates Coming Soon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Art/Music - I want to improve on the art and music but will keep the same big pixel resolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Make your way through the armies of robots to stop the one responsible! Collect coins to spend in store. Decorate your home. Then try some minigames!",
